## What it is built on

| Part | What it is | Its docs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [EHOS](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/eh-os) | The platform: identity, deployment, governance | Its [vision](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/eh-os/blob/main/docs/VISION.md), [architecture](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/eh-os/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) and [`ehos.yaml`](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/eh-os/blob/main/docs/ehos-yaml.md) |
| [`ehosctl`](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/ehos-tools/blob/main/packages/ehosctl/README.md) | The command-line tool: verify, deploy, call, upgrade | `ehosctl help <command>` |
| [`ehos_contract`](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/ehos_contract) | The contract engine: the domain and contract DSLs, dispatch, the event log | `<%= @contract_docs %>`, and the rest of `docs/` beside it |
| `ehos_contract_auth` | Verifies the credentials EHOS issues, and signs people in | `<%= @auth_readme %>` |
<%= unless @design_system_declined do %>| `ehos_design` | The EmpoweredHouse design system, the default look | `<%= @design_system %>/README.md` |
<% end %>| [`ehos_app`](https://github.com/EmpoweredHouse/ehos-tools) | The template, kept as a dependency so it can be upgraded | `<%= @ehos_app_readme %>` |

The paths are under `deps/`, at the versions `mix.lock` holds, once `mix deps.get` has run.
